, "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 20, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 8, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyscale"}, {"widget": {"name": "generate_audio_codes"}, "name": "generate_audio_codes", "label": "generate_audio_codes", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "generate_audio_codes"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_p"}, "name": "min_p", "label": "min_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "min_p"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n# 综合音乐风格分类体系\n\n## 1. 流行抒情 / Mandopop Ballad\n- **风格**：流行抒情、华语抒情、苦情歌\n- **BPM**：70–90\n- **调式**：A minor, C# minor, D minor, G major, C major\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：钢琴/弦乐主导，人声前置，主歌安静，副歌爆发，节奏平稳，情绪递进，清晰咬字\n\n## 2. 华语90年代经典\n- **风格**：90年代华语金曲、复古流行\n- **BPM**：72–88\n- **调式**：C# minor, D minor, F major, G major\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：电钢琴、弦乐、轻鼓组，旋律线条长，情感浓烈，结构标准（主歌-预副歌-副歌）\n\n## 3. 城市流行 / C-Pop\n- **风格**：现代都市流行、情歌\n- **BPM**：85–105\n- **调式**：C major, G major, A minor, B minor\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：现代编曲，合成器铺垫，鼓点清晰，人声靠前，旋律抓耳\n\n## 4. 民谣 / Folk\n- **风格**：民谣、木吉他民谣\n- **BPM**：65–85\n- **调式**：G major, C major, D major, A minor\n- **拍号**：4/4、6/8\n- **技术特征**：原声吉他为主，编曲极简，叙事感强，人声自然，节奏松散温柔\n\n## 5. 轻摇滚 / Soft Rock\n- **风格**：轻摇滚、流行摇滚\n- **BPM**：90–110\n- **调式**：C major, G major, D major, A minor\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：电吉他节奏层，鼓点有力，副歌高亢，整体明亮有力量\n\n## 6. R&B 抒情\n- **风格**：抒情R&B、90s R&B\n- **BPM**：70–95\n- **调式**：F minor, G minor, Bb major\n- **拍号**：4/4（三连音律动）\n- **技术特征**：切分节奏，转音多，贝斯流畅，钢琴和弦，人声慵懒细腻\n\n## 7. 爵士 / Jazz Ballad\n- **风格**：爵士抒情、冷爵士\n- **BPM**：60–80\n- **调式**：F major, Bb major, D minor, G minor\n- **拍号**：4/4、3/4\n- **技术特征**：爵士和弦，钢琴散拍，萨克斯/小号点缀，自由律动，氛围感强\n\n## 8. 影视原声 / Orchestral OST\n- **风格**：史诗、情感原声、纯音乐\n- **BPM**：65–90\n- **调式**：C minor, D minor, A minor, C major\n- **拍号**：4/4、3/4\n- **技术特征**：弦乐群，铜管铺垫，史诗感，情绪宏大，无鼓或轻鼓\n\n## 9. Lofi / Chillhop\n- **风格**：Lofi、放松、低保真\n- **BPM**：70–95\n- **调式**：C minor, A minor, D minor\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：黑胶底噪，简单鼓组，爵士和弦循环，安静治愈\n\n## 10. 电子氛围 / Ambient Electronic\n- **风格**：氛围电子、Chill电子\n- **BPM**：70–100\n- **调式**：大调/小调均可，偏氛围\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：长音垫，合成器铺底，节奏缓慢，空间感强\n\n## 11. House / 电子舞曲\n- **风格**：Deep House、Progressive House\n- **BPM**：120–128\n- **调式**：C minor, G minor, A minor\n- **拍号**：4/4（四四拍强底鼓）\n- **技术特征**：4/4 底鼓，贝斯律动，合成器主旋律，Drop段落\n\n## 12. 古风 / 中国风\n- **风格**：国风、古风、中式抒情\n- **BPM**：70–90\n- **调式**：五声调式，A minor, D minor, G major\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：古筝、笛子、琵琶，弦乐烘托，旋律婉转，意境悠远\n\n---\n\n# 你写歌最常用的「万能模板」（直接复制）\n### 虐心抒情\n- **风格**：华语抒情慢歌\n- **BPM**：80\n- **调式**：C# minor\n- **拍号**：4/4\n- **技术特征**：钢琴+弦乐，轻柔鼓点，主歌安静叙事，副歌高亢爆发，人声清晰咬字，情绪层层递进\n\n---"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [520.5888671875, 700.4404907226562], "pos": [-